id: DRAFT-12776-kea-admin-3.0.3-conan-verify-g4-local-cache-json-shape
title: 官方 conan-verify G4 与 conan 2.29.1 的 conan list --format=json 形状漂移：KeyError 被吞 → L2/L4/L5 静默跳过但 verdict 仍 PASS（平台级假绿）
category: ohos, conan, tooling, verification
build_system: conan|any
phase: verification
match_keywords: conan_verify, conan-verify, G4, artifact integrity, 无法找到程序包 ID, conan list, --format=json, Local Cache, KeyError, package id, L2, L4, L5, skip, conan 2.29.1, scripts/ohc
error_signature: "无法找到程序包 ID|KeyError.*Local Cache|Local Cache.*KeyError"
error_excerpt: "With conan 2.29.1, the official scripts/ohc/conan_verify.py G4 gate does `conan list <ref>:* --format=json` and parses listing['Local Cache'][self.software][self.ref]['revisions']. The actual JSON from conan 2.29.1 keys 'Local Cache' directly by the full reference string: {'Local Cache': {'kea-admin/3.0.3@ohpcd/stable': {'revisions': {...}}}}. The ['kea-admin'] index raises KeyError, which the gate catches and reports as '⚠️ 无法找到程序包 ID' - a PASS-looking detail line. Because _cache_path never gets set as a result, the follow-on gates L2 (smoke), L4 (security scan) and L5 (baseline) all print '⏭️ 跳过（无 cache 路径）' and the verdict still reads PASS. The verification appears green while three gates were never executed."
affected_scope: 一切使用官方 scripts/ohc/conan_verify.py 且 conan 为 2.29.1 的验证（与软件/语言/构建系统无关）：G4 告警「无法找到程序包 ID」后 L2/L4/L5 输出「跳过（无 cache 路径）」而结论仍 PASS——验证工具链层面的假绿，任何包同样命中。
root_cause: "Version skew between the runner's expected `conan list --format=json` document layout and conan 2.29.1's actual output: the runner assumes an extra software-name nesting level (['Local Cache']['<name>']['<full-ref>']) while 2.29.1 emits ['Local Cache']['<full-ref>'] flat. The parse failure is swallowed by `except (KeyError, IndexError, StopIteration)` and degrades silently (G4 keeps passed=True), so nothing in the report flags the skipped gates beyond the terse warning line."
rec_approach: "Do not trust a conan-verify verdict at face value: check G4's detail lines for the '无法找到程序包 ID' warning and each of L2/L4/L5 for '跳过（无 cache 路径）'. To restore full execution, shim the JSON before the runner parses it (transpose ['Local Cache']['<full-ref>'] -> ['Local Cache']['<name>']['<full-ref>']) or patch the runner's parse to accept both layouts. The same shim also protects against multiple cached revisions: purge first (`conan remove <ref> -c`) so exactly one revision/package exists and G4's `list(...values())[0]` pick is unambiguous."
solution: "ka_verify2.py driver imports the unmodified runner and wraps ConanVerifier._conan: for `list ... --format=json` calls it re-nests the flat full-ref keys under the software name when ['Local Cache'][software] is absent. After the shim, G4 resolves the package id, L2 actually smoke-runs bin/kea-admin, L4 scans (0 ELF in a script package -> pass), L5 saves the product baseline. Runner otherwise untouched; suggested upstream fix: derive software/ref from the actual dict keys (or accept both shapes) and make a failed parse FAIL the gate instead of degrading to PASS."
fallback: "If the shim is not available, query `conan cache path <ref>:<pkgid>` manually with the package id read from the raw JSON, and treat L2/L4/L5 as NOT RUN (not passed) in the verification notes."
prescan_pattern: "无法找到程序包 ID"
verify_builds: "kea-admin 3.0.3 (task 12776, 2026-10-04): before shim G4 warned '无法找到程序包 ID' and L2/L4/L5 skipped; after shim all gates executed on device with conan 2.29.1"
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-12776-kea-admin-3.0.3-conan-verify-g4-local-cache-json-shape.md
similar_to: E478
draft: true
severity: 2
last_updated: 2026-10-04
